<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
</head>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f5f5f5;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px;">
        <div style="background-color: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 40px;">
            <h1 style="color: #1a1a1a; font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 24px 0;">Your vehicles were delivered</h1>

            <p style="color: #4a4a4a; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
                <strong>{{ CompanyName }}</strong> delivered load #{{ LoadNumber }}{% if LoadName %} ({{ LoadName }}){% endif %}
                in {{ DestinationCity }} on {{ DeliveredAt }}{% if ReceiverName %}, signed for by {{ ReceiverName }}{% endif %}.
            </p>

            <div style="background-color: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 24px 0;">
                <p style="color: #6c757d; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Vehicles</p>
                {% for vehicle in Vehicles %}
                <p style="color: #1a1a1a; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 4px 0;">{{ vehicle }}</p>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>

            <p style="color: #4a4a4a; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
                The electronic bill of lading, with each vehicle's condition at pickup and delivery and both signatures,
                is in the customer portal.
            </p>

            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 32px 0;">
                <a href="{{ ShipmentUrl }}" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #1a1a1a; color: white; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500;">
                    View shipment and eBOL
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
